{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42437","headline":"早春寄华下同志 · 汤悦","name":"早春寄华下同志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正是花时节，思君寝复兴。\n市沽终不醉，春梦亦无凭。\n岳面悬清雨，河心走浊冰。\n东门一条路，离恨正相仍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汤悦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}